  {
   "turn": 3,
   "response_text": "This is very unusual. The validation accuracy is extremely high (~0.976-0.982), which is dramatically above the healthy range of 0.8538\u20130.8599. This is a significant anomaly. Let me check the training logs to see if there's anything suspicious:",
